{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15924","headline":"励学 · 王建","name":"励学","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"买地不肥实，其繁系耕凿。\n良田少锄理，兰焦香亦薄。\n勿以听者迷，故使宫徵错。\n谁言三岁童，还能分善恶。\n孜孜日求益，犹恐业未博。\n况我性顽蒙，复不勤修学。\n有如朝暮食，暂亏忧陨获。\n若使无六经，贤愚何所托。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15924.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15924","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}